{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108028","id":2622686049,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6cUwNh","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108028","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108028.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108028.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108028","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108028/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108028/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108028/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5230f6c60c28b1a34fb0136f84aa901afe382f39","number":108028,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Metal: Use image atomic operations on supported Apple hardware","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Metal is capable of atomic image operations on supported hardware, so this PR enables it at runtime when the support is available.\r\n\r\n# 🗒️ Changes\r\n\r\n- Added image atomics feature to `RenderingDevice`\r\n- 🚀 Changed default compute encoder to execute dispatch calls concurrently\r\n- Updated SPIRV-Cross to include atomic fixes\r\n- Reduce CPU overhead in Metal driver by avoiding unnecessary API calls\r\n  - Reduces API warnings when running Godot under Xcode Metal Debugger for unnecessary state changes\r\n\r\n# 🚀 Performance\r\n\r\n## 4.5 / main with M4 MacBook Pro Max\r\n\r\nUsing the Fog Stress project with `--fog-volumes 5000`\r\n\r\n* **Atomics PR (enabled)**: this PR with image atomics enabled for fog volumes (default)\r\n* **Atomics PR (disabled)**: this PR with image atomics disabled via environment variable\r\n* **Beta 1**\r\n\r\nThe following chart shows FPS percentiles and GPU time percentiles. This PR is almost 2x!\r\n\r\n![percentile_comparison](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/453bc683-ab1b-478c-a2ea-96ee42da70ce)\r\n\r\nThe following chart is GPU frame time, over time, and also shows a very consistent 2x improvement.\r\n\r\n![time_series_gpu_time_ms](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a6465377-bee8-40ed-b18c-cd21d46bc986)\r\n\r\nFinally, note that atomic operations on images or buffers appears to be similar.\r\n\r\n### Godot Reflection (Tesseract) Benchmark\r\n\r\nAlso worth noting that other benchmarks show a GPU time improvement too.\r\n\r\n![percentile_comparison](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1207ef71-e90f-4f07-94ae-f10bd42980aa)\r\n\r\n## 4.5 / main with M1 MacBook Pro Max\r\n\r\nUsing the Fog Stress project with `--fog-volumes 5000`\r\n\r\nThe following chart shows FPS percentiles and GPU time percentiles. The difference is more significant.\r\n\r\n![percentile_comparison](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5f316d95-6ab0-4b3e-bb76-db090eff3c05)\r\n\r\nThe following chart is GPU frame time, over time, and also shows a very consistent 7x improvement.\r\n\r\n![time_series_gpu_time_ms](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/34fdbcf7-199a-4f39-a638-87bc3b7ce36f)\r\n\r\n\r\n## Why is M1 faster in these tests?\r\n\r\nMy M4 is running multiple displays, which is affecting FPS, the M1 is only running built-in display.\r\n\r\n# 🥼 Testing\r\n\r\n[fog_stress.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21025142/fog_stress.zip)\r\n\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> \r\n> To disable image atomics, you can specify the following environment variable when launching Godot:\r\n>\r\n> ```\r\n> GODOT_METAL_DISABLE_IMAGE_ATOMICS=1\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nVolumetric Fog from Godot Demo Projects\r\n\r\n- ✅ MacBook Pro M4\r\n- ✅ iPhone 12 Pro (Apple6 GPU)\r\n\r\n\r\n> [!IMPORTANT]\r\n>\r\n> This would supersede @akien-mga's update of SPIRV-Cross in #107773, as I had to patch it to fix the MSL generation. A `.patch` file is included and [an issue](https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Cross/issues/2502) opened for the SPIRV-Cross project.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z"},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-06-27T00:00:34Z","updated_at":"2025-07-08T22:27:07Z","closed_at":"2025-07-07T15:14:06Z","merged_at":"2025-07-07T15:14:05Z","merge_commit_sha":"db1b6b93562ff93adb2808b2c93ab3c63074b301","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"stu